@startuml
title <b>Bytes N Bites: Stage 3 class diagram</b>\n<size:12>Stage 2 + Host, combo meals, Happy Hour</size>
set separator none
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam linetype polyline
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam nodesep 45
skinparam ranksep 70
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam classFontStyle bold
skinparam ArrowColor #444444
skinparam classBorderColor #555555
skinparam classBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam packageBorderColor #333333
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF8DC
skinparam noteBorderColor #C9B458
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
hide empty members

legend top right
|<#C8E6C9>  | New in Stage 3 |
|<#FFF59D>  | Code changed in Stage 3 |
|<#FFFFFF>  | Unchanged since Stage 2 (comment-only edits not marked) |
Scope: game engine (restaurant-rush). The web edition
server (rush.web) is drawn in the Stage 4 diagram.
Visibility: + public  - private  # protected  ~ package
{leaf} = final method.  "accessors" lists the simple getters;
each returns the attribute of the same name.
endlegend

